++R1_15A2 V24915 PERF2C R2 — POKRACOVANI Z B0018 DO SUPPLY
++
++Tento balík opravuje live pád:
++  sqlite3.OperationalError: attempt to write a readonly database
++pri CREATE TEMP TABLE current_impact.
++
++Persistent SQLite cache zustava otevrena pres URI mode=ro; hlavni DB je stale read-only.
++Povolena je pouze connection-local TEMP schema v pameti, kterou Supply impact potrebuje.
++R2 navic rekonstruuje cal_indices/protected, ktere parent open_existing() neobnovoval.
++
++NEOPAKUJ Demand z B0016.
++
++1. Ve Visumu otevri:
++   ACCEPTED_B_0018_3d57d34487ba.ver
++
++   Puvodni live cesta byla:
++   R1_15A2_V24915_PERF2_RUNS\RUN_20261020_004141_848876\CALIBRATION\CHECKPOINTS\ACCEPTED_B_0018_3d57d34487ba.ver
++
++2. Rozbal cely R2 ZIP do nove prazdne slozky.
++
++3. Ve Visumu zvol Scripts -> Execute script file.
++
++4. Spust VYHRADNE:
++   R1_15A2_SUPPLY_ONLY_PERSISTENT_PATH_CACHE_V2_4_9_15_PERF2C_R2.py
++
++Supply-only handoff pred trial writes vyzada platny DEMAND_CONVERGED.json z ancestry checkpointu
++a porovna jeho state_hash s prave otevrenym B0018. Pri neshode failne zavrene.
++
++Pro novy kompletni beh od B0016 existuje i FULL launcher:
++   R1_15A2_FULL_OVERNIGHT_PERSISTENT_PATH_CACHE_V2_4_9_15_PERF2C.py
++Ale pro aktualni pokracovani jej nepouzivej — opakoval by Demand.
